      <h2>English Summary</h2>
      <p>For support, contact <a href="mailto:zwyyy456@foxmail.com">zwyyy456@foxmail.com</a>. The Safari and Firefox extensions can extract the sentence containing a looked-up word. In other apps, send selected text to FlashDict through macOS Services or the iOS/iPadOS share sheet. Dictionary files must be imported separately on each device. Flashcard sync requires the same iCloud account and iCloud sync enabled in the app.</p>
</Document>
